5449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I never had a good answer for this either. From talking to other VR engineers most are in the same boat as us. The few vendors that have thrown serious money at testing different approaches and finding out what works best, don't seem to be sharing those findings (or I am just not looking in the right places, totally possible:) ). \r\n\r\nI thus also have no opinion on which is best. I'm happy to switch to the more rounded approach.","created_at":"2024-11-22T23:38:25Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T23:42:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99551#discussion_r1854901015","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99551","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1854901015"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99551#discussion_r1854901015"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99551"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1854901015/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"